              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Based on the Cross Sell Accounts {{$context.$nodes.SLICE_THE_TOP_5_ROWS.$output.result}}, generate concise professional sumamry in 2 lines\nInclude the following as a title to the combined Summary \"Top Cross Sell and Renewal Insights\"\nBased on the Renewal Accounts "
