          "code": "WIDGET_DISPLAY",
          "id": "1776903433596",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776903433596_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate oraInfoDisplay as per multiRecordWidget standards and no other extra text to be included in output"
            },
            {
              "id": "1776903433596_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "DATA: {{$context.$nodes.SLICE_THE_TOP_5_ROWS.$output.result}}\n\nGenerate a multiRecordWidget using the data with columns:\n- \"Product\"\n- \"Accounts\"\n- \"Revenue\"\n\nset Title: <Generate a 3-4 words based on the data> \nset Description: <Generate a 1-2 professional sentence based on the data> \n\nFor the \"Product\" column, use targetProductName from each row and add a drillDownAction that invokes \"ora.Invoke(launchCrossSellProduct,{targetProductId:<productId>,targetProductId:<productName>,programType:Cross-Sell})\" using the targetProductId and targetProductName from each row.\nFor the \"Accounts\" column, use accounts from each row but always convert it to a string\nFor the \"Revenue\" column, format arr from each row into a human-readable\nstring using suffixes: \"B\" for billions, \"M\" for millions, and \"k\" for\nthousands.\n\nExamples: 1.23B, 3.45M, 100k.\n\nEnsure the revenue values are rounded to two decimal places when using suffixes.\n\nAlso, For the first row in the data set, create following low actionable insights:\n\n1. A low priority actionable insight with the following fields:\n- title: \"Launch <targetProductName> Cross-Sell Advisor\" (replace <targetProductName> with the actual product name from the first row)\n- shortDescription: generate a concise promotional description to cross-sell the targetProductName\n- actionText: \"Launch <targetProductName> Cross-Sell Advisor\" (replace <targetProductName> with the actual product name from the first row)\n- followUpCommand: ora.Invoke(\"launchCrossSellProduct\",\"targetProductId=<targetProductId>,targetProductName=<targetProductName>\")\n- priority: false"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 5450,
            "y": 6982
          }
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Init Actions"
          },
