            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "INIT_ACTIONS",
          "id": "1776904218705",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776904218705_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "DATA: {{$context.$nodes.SLICE_THE_TOP_5_ROWS.$output.result}}\n\nFor the first row in the data set, create following actionable insights:\n\n1. A high priority actionable insight with the following fields:\n- title: use the targetProductName from the first row\n- shortDescription: generate a concise promotional description to cross-sell the targetProductName\n- actionText: \"Launch Cross-Sell Advisor\"\n- followUpCommand: ora.Invoke(\"launchCrossSellProduct\",\"targetProductId=<targetProductId>,targetProductName=<targetProductName>\") from the first row\n- priority: true\n\n\nEnsure the output clearly distinguishes the insights and uses the exact field names as specified."
            },
